<title>USA: Clinton welcomes G7 leaders to annual summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton welcomes G7 leaders to annual summit.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders of the Group of Seven industrialized nations and Russia opened an annual summit onFriday.</p>
<p>Host President Bill Clinton welcomed his colleagues from France, Germany, Britain, Italy, Canada, Japan and Russia to a reception at Denver's Governors Mansion. They were due to attend a working dinner later where Bosnia was expected to be the main item of discussion.</p>
</text>
